{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20261Jo63rBzqo1795345739.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>尖沙咀寶勒巷有私家車剷上行人路，一死三人受傷。司機懷疑棄車逃去。警方指初步拘捕一人，涉嫌危險駕駛引致他人死亡。據了解涉及一名38歲男子，酒精測試超標。事發前私家車已在附近先後撞毁一枝交通燈，及撞到一架輕型貨車。</p><p></p><p>有市民拍攝到事發一刻，見到多名市民倒臥地上、失去知覺，有市民圍觀，亦有人上前幫忙。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.CAR 1830.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20269ShRO8TqxH1795348769.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.CAR 1830_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Vx9nYsuBYg1795348685.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>有店舖閉路電視就影到，當時有途人慌忙入餐廳躲避。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.CAR-1900-1_CLEAN_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026OrAPtwlNCJ1795353044.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.CAR 1830_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026NnoeKi0r3i1795348661.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>另一段網上片段見到，事發後穿棕色衣服的男子，從涉事私家車下車，與同行女友人離開。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.CAR 1830_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026dHpNsHTfFi1795348705.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>警方下午約兩時半接報，指尖沙咀寶勒巷六號，有私家車剷上行人路，有人報稱店舖廚房被撞。一輛白色私家車之後停在行人路，見到車頭損毀嚴重。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.CAR 1830_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DG7z8YoeGP1795348725.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>車尾附近一段路，見到有汽車零件，包括車頭燈，散落一地，其中一邊多條欄杆懷疑被撞爛。多架單車連外賣被撞到扭曲，地面有血漬。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.CAR 1830_005.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026TbOFFH9z5x1795348745.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.CAR-1900-1_CLEAN_006.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026atlMUCIseH1795353133.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.CAR 1830_006.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026icKEwVTSGE1795348798.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>張太說：「我在快餐店食午餐，突然間『嘭』爆炸一聲，很害怕。見到很像拍戲，現場見到有點害怕。見到一男一女下車走，一個途人追著他們。」</p><p></p><p>徐先生稱：「兩個司機一男一女，下車後施然地離開，有人喝停兩人，不准走不准走，兩人照樣走像若無其事。見到背影似乎很年輕。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.CAR-1900-1_CLEAN_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zXYLoFKm7G1795353097.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>對於司機懷疑棄車逃走，警方事後在同區拘捕一人，涉嫌危險駕駛引致他人死亡等。據了解被捕男子38歲，在酒精測試中超標。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.CAR 1830_008.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20260cuulxVLeC1795348825.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>事發現場寶勒巷這段路，周邊有不少食肆，車路比較窄，若果有車不小心剷上行人路，對行人風險相對較大。</p><p></p><p>事件中兩男兩女受傷，其中一名男傷者，昏迷送院後證實不治，消息指，他跟另一名男傷者都是南亞裔。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.CAR 1900 up2035.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026NmFQt76UFv1795353072.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T14:23:48.580204+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":622,"images":13,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T10:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T16:57:38.632778+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T14:17:13.883473+00:00","content_hash":"4bb5e832b474434cce0ba942837daaa1dada249346cac986309ef25dfde7d91d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}